 will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                         =
       &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                            =
    &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                                =
    &lt;p&gt;Next, your screen will display the Add Printer option.=0A           =
                                                         &lt;/p&gt;=0A           =
