 text-primary&quot;&gt;Wi-Fi / Wireless setup (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A                        =
                                    &lt;ul class=3D&quot;scannerissuelisting p-0&quot;&gt;=
=0A                                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A =
                                                                   &lt;p&gt;First=
ly, you will need to turn on the Mac device and=0A                         =
                                               printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A             =
                                                   &lt;/li&gt;=0A                =
                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A                    =
                                                &lt;p&gt;Next, connect the printe=
r to the wireless network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                          =
                      &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                             =
                   &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                 =
                   &lt;p&gt;Now, go to the official page and download the printer=
=0A                                                                        =
driver.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                             =
   &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                                =
&lt;li&gt;=0A                                                                    =
&lt;p&gt;Then, complete the driver installation process.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                  =
                                              &lt;/li&gt;=0A                     =
